Z||000002||deceler8||07-01-2001||10:50 AM||||Get a measuring tape and measure your old seats. Then take a trip to the boneyard with measurements in hand and get a set of seats.<P>I've heard of folks on the Forum using Cavalier seats, Camaro, Firebird, Geo Storm...about the only problem you'll have with seats from other cars is the height of the seat bottom relative to the floor, and the mounting points.||||reg||1
